msgid ""
"*The Open CCB is not yet commercially available - we are actively seeking "
"manufacturers. (even though this topic is archived!)* If you want to start "
"making and selling this board please contact CraigElder@uniserve."
msgstr ""
"*开放式CCB尚未商业化——我们正在积极寻找制造商。（即使此主题已归档！）* 若您有意生产和销售该板子，请联系CraigElder@uniserve。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:14
#: 099ce2e03c8a4b179bbc803000b6ec77 0de37d68020f442ab83fb4c4456da8fd
#: c1d86305dd534f258d16ca213a207005 dedaeec4999a40bf889784e089daaa9a
#: eed0af1400df4b75bfb64466a89e3792
msgid ""
"The Open Camera Control Board (OpenCCB) is a camera remote control interface"
" for aerial photography. It has :ref:`many features <common-camera-control-"
"board_port_mapping>`, including: FTDI USB/UART adapter, USB HOST, Digital "
"IO, Analog IO, Optocoupled IO, etc."
msgstr ""
"开放式相机控制板（OpenCCB）是用于航空摄影的相机遥控接口，具有 :ref:`多种功能 <common-camera-control-"
"board_port_mapping>`，包括：FTDI USB/UART适配器、USB HOST、数字IO、模拟IO、光耦合IO等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:21
#: 213705ff4ed84b54b564b39815d3e4a5 2cd10c31ec5e4f8295c73a9b139d2bc7
#: 40afc7e74e4e4c5d95a246b2e12f4b9c 77b0f8c9cb6b4f14bd16111e82aeaf3f
#: b65677544a79423ba2d96a4c5044c2e4
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:26
#: 2150db1aa2d447d8ba8f936f006c01d1 46d8bd9481ce40edabddb0f5d9e5e28e
#: 550b2c9a9bc2460bb34ff689f64b5cc5 a541480b256e4610994cdbf2b90d453d
#: c099964880c74bed8bc8ed3020cbd546
msgid ""
"The main camera control protocol used is known as PTP (Picture Transfer "
"Protocol), which was originally standardized as PIMA 15740:2000, ISO "
"15740:2005(V1.0), and ISO 15740:2008(V1.1)."
msgstr ""
"主要使用的相机控制协议称为PTP（图片传输协议），最初标准化为PIMA 15740:2000、ISO 15740:2005(V1.0)和ISO "
"15740:2008(V1.1)。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:30
#: 02f7ae976b044d33a35eb020496fc793 1762be0dd6144533bc47952ea62e9238
#: 5dd630d8e8dc4f68b409a6e2d54e74aa 65969ee417bf4e29b26e95a043403529
#: ff384ac5991044be80a234fec3c8731d
msgid ""
"The PTP has been supported by almost all cameras since 2005, but often in a "
"limited fashion. Only few cameras have the \"PTP Remote Control\" feature. "
"Canon, for example, removed the remote control feature from their compact "
"line (PowerShot models) in the last PS SDK in 2009 (PS-ReCSDK 1.1.0e)."
msgstr ""
"自2005年以来，几乎所有相机都支持PTP，但通常功能有限。只有少数相机具有「PTP遥控」功能。例如，佳能在2009年的最后一个PS SDK（PS-"
"ReCSDK 1.1.0e）中从其小型消费机（PowerShot型号）中移除了遥控功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:36
#: 2a2c981a0b6a45d286c0b5fd74572e3a cb80af67337d48259b30f040ce9807a3
#: d95da983dba84a7a99df9f985b73e5bf f646a9c425f149b1acd3ecf8277b3db7
#: f9d2c7f8ea71444799a1bb5f834c99cd
msgid ""
"Fortunately the PTP hacking extension in the `CHDK project "
"<http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/PTP_Extension>`__ allows us to extend the PTP "
"control to newer, smaller and lighter Canon PowerShot models."
msgstr ""
"幸运的是，`CHDK项目 <http://chdk.wikia.com/wiki/PTP_Extension>`__ "
"中的PTP黑客扩展使我们能够将PTP控制扩展到更新、更小、更轻的佳能PowerShot型号。"

