#: b575df4e9a7241ecb8d996e4d66ff92e
msgid ""
"That function does send attitude and GPS data to a file on the camera's SD "
"card. It does call and communicate with the camera through a local `CHDK "
"script <https://github.com/sandrobenigno/3dr-camera-"
"ctrl/tree/master/CHDK/SCRIPTS>`__."
msgstr ""
"该函数将姿态和GPS数据发送到相机SD卡上的文件。它通过本地 `CHDK脚本 "
"<https://github.com/sandrobenigno/3dr-camera-"
"ctrl/tree/master/CHDK/SCRIPTS>`__ 调用并与相机通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-camera-control-board.rst:325
