"messages for the whole set of functions that the board will translate into "
"setup and triggering. You can see here the suggested entries, though it "
"could be expressed in many other ways on a future implementation:"
msgstr "为使其完整工作，飞控应实现特定消息，用于板子将转化为设置和触发的完整功能集。以下是建议的条目，尽管在未来实现中可以有许多其他表达方式："

